HPx-eos/THERMOCALC authors and collaborators. [Official models, explanation, downloads, and resource hub](https://hpxeosandthermocalc.org/).

Read the model and phase-equilibrium explanations with the full methods papers for the selected endmember/solution models. Preserve dataset version, reference state, composition basis, calibration range, assumptions, and software implementation. A calculation using a model is distinct from the experimental/thermodynamic evidence supporting it.

The site makes these resources freely available for academic research and identifies THERMOCALC as Roger Powell and Tim Holland's intellectual property. This is not a blanket unrestricted licence, nor the unrelated commercial Thermo-Calc product. Official identity, scope, terms distinction, and current source routes checked on 29 October 2026. All models, software, papers, and data remain external references.

